# Purple handoff supplements

Core session-start, task-completion, and ratchet discipline:
`.cursor/rules/compounding-memory.mdc`. This file adds Purple-only requirements.

## Session start (in addition to compounding-memory)

For Purple operational detail (TestFlight, Doppler, gates), skim `CURSOR_HANDOFF.md`
quick-facts and the section matching your task.

## Task completion (in addition to compounding-memory)

Also update when relevant:

- `CURSOR_HANDOFF.md` — operational runbook detail (TestFlight, deploy, verify commands).
- Relevant `docs/*.md` runbooks, `AGENTS.md`, `mem/`, `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` per
  `post-task-documentation.mdc`.

## Install kit on other repos

Run `scripts/install-handoff-kit.sh` from repo root (idempotent; skips existing files).
